  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 1310690,
    "RowId": 26805,
    "Description": "Allows the execution of <If(Equal(PlayerParameter(68),18))><If(GreaterThanOrEqualTo(PlayerParameter(69),91))><span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Mooch</span> or <span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Spareful Hand</span><Else/><span style=\"color: #ff7b1a;\">Mooch</span></If><Else/> </If> even with average-sized fish.\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Duration: </span>145s\n<span style=\"color: #00cc22;\">Angler's Art Cost: </span>5\nAction has no effect on fish caught prior to execution."
  },
